  "english": "Eve of the Fast of Saint James.\n\n15. Wednesday. Tone 2 [BZ / Bdz]. Fast. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 8 [d-dz]: \"Lord God of ours, who established...\"\n19. Sunday. Tone 8 [D-Ch / Ddz]. Fourth [Sunday]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 7 [e3 / ek]: \"Glorified Son of God, who...\"\nIn the Evening: Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 8 [d-dz]: \"Preceding [the women]...\" and \"With Your terrifying voice...\" and \"You who are beyond comprehension...\"\n20. Monday. Tone 8 [D-K / Dk]. Saint Ignatius and Saint Addai, bishops, and Marutha [the bishop] and Theopompus, bishop, and Theonas the martyr, and the four soldiers: Bassus, Eusebius, Eutychius, and Basilides.\n21. Tuesday. Tone 1 [A-Z / Az]. King Abgar. The Scripture reading and Gospel are the same as for [the Feast of] Theodosius.\n23. Thursday. Tone 2 [B-Z / Bz]. David the Prophet and James the Apostle.\n26. Sunday. Tone 6 [G-K / Gk]. Fifth [Sunday]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 6 [g-k]: \"Before eternity.\" Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 6 [g-k]: \"Having taken [from us]...\" to the end.\n28. Tuesday. Tone 8 [D-K / Dk]. Sons of Thunder: James and John.\n29. Wednesday. Tone 1 [A-dz / Az]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 8 [d-k]: \"God of our fathers, have mercy.\" Eve of the Fast of the Nativity.\n\nJanuary:\n2. Sunday. Tone 5 [G-Ch-Z / Gdz]. Sixth [Sunday]. Fast. Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 5 [Gdz]: \"Glorified is Your resurrection...\" to the end.\n3. Monday. Tone 6 [G-K / Gk]. Fast. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 8 [d-k]: \"Blessed are You, Lord God of our fathers, straight are [Your] ways.\"\n5. Wednesday. Tone 8 [D-k-K / Dk]. Eve of the Nativity of Christ.\n\nNovember:\n21. Sunday. Tone 2 [B-Z / Bz]. Eleventh [Sunday]. Feast of the Presentation of the Holy Mother of God [in the Temple]. Eve of the Advent Fast.\n22. Monday. Tone 4 [B-K / Bk]. Advent Fast. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 3 [b1 / bk]: \"God, exalted, awesome, and wonderful.\"\n28. Sunday. Tone 2 [A-K / Ak]. First [Sunday]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 2 [a-k]: \"Who for our salvation descended from heaven.\" Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [a-k]: \"The wonderful angel of the Lord.\"\n29. Monday. Tone 2 [B-dz / Bdz]. The virgins Juliana and Vasilouhi, and Indos and Domna, and Glerikos the priest, and the two myriad [martyrs]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 8 [d-k]: \"You who are exalted...\"\n\nDecember:\n5. Sunday. Tone 1 [A-d-Z / Adz]. Second [Sunday]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 2 [b-dz]: \"Incorruptible Word of God.\" Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 1 [Adz]: \"By Your ineffable essence...\"\n6. Monday. Tone 2 [A-K / Ak]. Genarius the bishop, and Mercurius the soldier, and the martyrs Jacob and Iravapar.\n7. Tuesday. Tone 2 [B-Z / Bz]. Egyptian Fathers: Paul, Macarius, Evagrius, and the others.\n9. Thursday. Tone 6 [G-Z / Gdz]. Feast of the Conception of the Holy Virgin by Anna.\n12. Sunday. Tone 8 [D-K / Dk]. Third [Sunday]. Patristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 4 [b-k]: \"Without beginning, God and Almighty.\"\nIn the Evening: Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 8 [d-k]: \"Your angel, O Lord...\"",
